            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melanie Smith"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yum! Everyone liked! Used jasmine rice instead of basmati. Doubled recipe for 4 of us and no leftovers. Saved a step by not heating up chicken broth and used 2 c of broth (as liquid amount on rice directions) instead of the called-for doubled amount of 1 1/2. Added margarine when added broth. Simmered for 20 min.",
            "datePublished": "2017-03-20T22:50:55.420Z"
          },
          {
